Turbo Decoder
Turbo encoding adds smart extra bits before sending.
👉 Turbo decoding at the receiver uses those bits to recover the original correct data.
• Device used to analyze encoded wireless signals.
• Threat: Can demonstrate signal interception risks.
• Ethical Use: Used to test communication encryption security.

